{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall do et my statutes.</b> The commandments dependent on the land, practiced in the Sabbatical year and in the Jubilee." "<b>And my ordinances.</b> Such as ״אל תונו איש את אחיו״." "<b>And you shall dwell on the land in safety.</b> As reward for keeping my commandments; and you shall not fear being exiled from it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:11.563240523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}